{"text": "One horizon of the car entering the first bend, solved from scratch in two ways. On the left, single shooting: the only unknowns are the twenty-five inputs, and the path comes from simulating them, so it is always one unbroken line. It starts as straight ahead and bends towards the green reference points, iteration by iteration. On the right, multiple shooting: the start of every piece is an unknown too. Each piece is simulated on its own, and at first they do not join: the coral gaps are the dynamics not yet satisfied. One iteration nearly closes them. Watch the end: both methods arrive at the same plan.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 40.325, "words": [[0.1, 0.325, "One"], [0.325, 0.75, "horizon"], [0.75, 0.8, "of"], [0.8, 0.875, "the"], [0.875, 1.337, "car"], [1.625, 1.875, "entering"], [1.875, 1.938, "the"], [1.938, 2.288, "first"], [2.288, 2.6, "bend"], [3.0, 3.312, "solved"], [3.312, 3.438, "from"], [3.45, 4.05, "scratch"], [4.062, 4.2, "in"], [4.213, 4.45, "two"], [4.45, 5.025, "ways"], [5.425, 5.525, "On"], [5.525, 5.613, "the"], [5.612, 6.087, "left"], [6.237, 6.612, "single"], [6.625, 7.1, "shooting"], [7.338, 7.438, "the"], [7.45, 7.788, "only"], [7.8, 8.375, "unknowns"], [8.375, 8.425, "are"], [8.425, 8.5, "the"], [8.5, 9.088, "twenty-five"], [9.1, 9.762, "inputs"], [9.975, 10.237, "and"], [10.5, 10.588, "the"], [10.588, 11.013, "path"], [11.012, 11.262, "comes"], [11.275, 11.412, "from"], [11.412, 12.05, "simulating"], [12.05, 12.238, "them"], [12.5, 12.75, "so"], [13.25, 13.3, "it"], [13.3, 13.413, "is"], [13.412, 13.8, "always"], [13.8, 14.238, "one"], [14.338, 14.95, "unbroken"], [14.95, 15.35, "line"], [15.75, 15.812, "It"], [15.825, 16.2, "starts"], [16.2, 16.3, "as"], [16.312, 16.65, "straight"], [16.65, 17.037, "ahead"], [17.212, 17.362, "and"], [17.375, 17.738, "bends"], [17.738, 18.088, "towards"], [18.087, 18.175, "the"], [18.175, 18.6, "green"], [18.6, 18.95, "reference"], [18.962, 19.5, "point